From a0e6d38b18c272eb82a61f61a80f4221592e0539 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Work Leaf Bench <bench@example.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 06:24:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD terminal visual yanking so pane text can be copied
 with vim motions

TerminalUi owns character, line, and block visual selections for both panes, maps the active pane content into selectable lines, emits OSC52 clipboard updates for yanks, and keeps terminal shortcut handling aware of active visual state. The harness coverage exercises left-pane, right-pane, block, and uppercase line yanks, including agent rows below detail lines.
